0 // Description: Microscale 4 x 11 stud frigate hull (14 studs with the bowsprit): raked bow, stepped forecastle, waist and quarterdeck, gunport band. The NPC frigate is this hull with three masts, square sails and eight cannons.
0 // Parts: 49 (all inside the grouped submodel npc-frigate-hull.ldr, the hull of the NPC frigate in src/Sails/NpcShips.elm)
0 // Hull only: no mast or sail (add them in the editor)
0 // Bounds LDU: x -52..52, y -84..24, z -180..100 (size 104 x 108 x 280)
0 // Front / bow towards -Z, -Y up. The whole base is one submodel reference: move it as one piece.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 npc-frigate-hull.ldr
0 NOFILE
